sequenceDiagram
    participant Timer as cycle_timer
    participant Handler as cycle_timer_handler()
    participant Beacon as beacon_update_timer()
    participant Utils as Utils Functions
    participant BT as Bluetooth Stack
    
    Note over Timer: 🔄 广播和信标管理流程 (每1000ms循环)
    
    Timer->>+Handler: cycle_timer_handler()
    Handler->>Handler: Update cycle_start_time<br/>Increment cycle_sequence
    Handler->>Handler: reset_registration_slots()
    Handler->>+Timer: k_timer_start(beacon_timer, 5ms)
    Timer-->>-Handler: Beacon timer started
    Handler-->>-Timer: Cycle handler complete
    
    Note over Timer: 📡 信标更新流程 (每5ms)
    loop Every 5ms
        Timer->>+Beacon: beacon_update_timer()
        Beacon->>Beacon: Calculate current_slot<br/>slot_remaining_ms
        Beacon->>+Utils: get_master_rtc_time()
        Utils-->>-Beacon: RTC timestamp
        Beacon->>Beacon: update_slot_status(beacon)
        
        alt Current slot >= 10 (Data Slot)
            Beacon->>Beacon: prepare_request_data(beacon, slot)
        end
        
        Beacon->>+BT: bt_le_adv_update_data(beacon)
        BT-->>-Beacon: Advertising data updated
        Beacon-->>-Timer: Beacon updated
    end